<title>UK: London silver fixes off bottom but under pressure.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes off bottom but under pressure.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 427.75 cents vs 425.00 cents previously. Recovered on short covering late Tuesday but weakened under pressure from gold later. Support at 425 cents.</p>
<p>GOLD - Weaker but off floor at $316.80/$317.20. Vulnerable to more short selling. May probe $313.60 low.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Also easier at $396.00/$400.00, down $14.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $4.00 at $170.00/$174.00.</p>
</text>
